<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippines January inflation at 5.0 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Philippines January inflation at 5.0 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippines posted year-on-year inflation of 5.0 percent in January, the National Statistics Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The office also announced that it had revised the figure for inflation recorded in December to 5.2 percent year-on-year from the 5.1 percent announced earlier.</p>
<p>    CONSUMER PRICES		    Jan 97    Dec 96     Jan 96</p>
<p>    Month/month change (pct)	  0.6	 0.8	   0.8</p>
<p>    Year/year change (pct)	    5.0	 5.2	  11.2</p>
<p>    Index (base 100 = 1988)	 233.0     231.5	 221.9</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom (632) 841-8934</p>
